    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a single 18 years old indie game developer (me). The game revolves around <strong>team-vs-team battles</strong> on a <strong>procedural map</strong>, all presented in a <strong>cheerful pixel art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is inspired by insects, featuring unique gameplay that reflects their real-life behaviors, blended with elements of human culture from various regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.poster.avif?t=1737584480\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.webm?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.mp4?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the game, you will need to choose a faction based on the strengths and weaknesses of your team, the procedurally generated map, and your personal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Depending on the faction you select, you can extract different resources, so the distribution of resources and the composition of your team are key factors when deciding on a faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an <strong>early stage of development</strong>, and it's very possible that my vision for it will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.poster.avif?t=1737584480\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.webm?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.mp4?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lustle</strong> is a small <strong>RTS game</strong> created by a single 18 years old indie game developer (me). The game revolves around <strong>team-vs-team battles</strong> on a <strong>procedural map</strong>, all presented in a <strong>cheerful pixel art style</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each faction is inspired by insects, featuring unique gameplay that reflects their real-life behaviors, blended with elements of human culture from various regions of the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.poster.avif?t=1737584480\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.webm?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/767f8380967b989568a1e38c3261a2eb.mp4?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>In the game, you will need to choose a faction based on the strengths and weaknesses of your team, the procedurally generated map, and your personal playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Depending on the faction you select, you can extract different resources, so the distribution of resources and the composition of your team are key factors when deciding on a faction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is in an <strong>early stage of development</strong>, and it's very possible that my vision for it will evolve over time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.poster.avif?t=1737584480\" width=800 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.webm?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3447760/extras/26b67360f4dfba7ec4a5dbc8ae7ad6a2.mp4?t=1737584480\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Lustle is a small RTS game featuring economy building, combat, unique factions, procedural maps, and a cheerful pixel art style. In the game, you can play as factions such as bees, termites, ants, and other insect-based nations, each offering unique gameplay inspired by their real-life behaviors.",
